  <para style="h">Udiana Ñwed Kọrint</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Kọrint</para>
  <para style="toc2">Udiana Ñwed Kọrint</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Kọr</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Kọrint</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Ami Pọọl a-ndooho mbed Krais Yisọs ke uduak Abasi, ye Timoti ayịneka ñnyịn awodeen ke Krais, iwet ñwed ami inọọ ufọkabasi a-abaaha ke Kọrint ye afịd ndisana ikọd Abasi ke afịd Akaiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Yak mfọn ye emem Abasi Ete ñnyịn ye Abọọñ Yisọs Krais aba ye ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itooro Anie Abasi Afịd Idọñesịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Ekọọm anie Abasi, Ete Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais, Ete mbọm ye Ete afịd idọñesịd, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />i-idọññọ ñnyịn esịd ke afịd mfịna ñnyịn, nọ ato do ñnyịn ikan idọñ mbon e-ebaaha ke mfịna ato idọñesịd a-ñnyịn ke idem ñnyịn ibọọhọ ito Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Sia, kpa naña ñnyịn iwuana ayọhọ-ayọhọ ke ufen Krais, kpa ntoro, ato ke Krais, ke idọñesịd ñnyịn ayọhọ aduọi. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Adieke ñnyịn ikịtte ukuud, ado nọ ndufo enie idọñesịd ye adinyaaña a-anamma ndufo enie ukeme adibiom ukem-ukem ndutʌhọ a-ñnyịn ke idem ñnyịn ikịtte. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ñnyịn imiinyʌñ inie idodanyen a-asọññọ ada, sia ñnyịn imiidiọọñọ ke kpa naña ndufo ewuana ke ukuud ñnyịn, kpa ntoro ke ndufo ewuana ke idọñesịd ñnyịn.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Mme nditọeka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek adelfọi a-adaaha anọ </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nditọeka </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ideen me ibaan</char><char style="ft" closed="false">anyʌñ asʌk ada anọ ideen ye ibaan e-enịmme Krais ke akpanikọ, nte atu ubon Abasi; se ñko ke 2 Kọrint 8:1; 2 Kọrint 13:11</char></note> ke Krais, ñnyịn iyemme ndufo enana ifiọk ebaña mfịna a-ñnyịn ikikịtte ke Esia. Ñnyịn ikiba ke idak akpọsọñ mbiomo akan naña ñnyịn ikpikikan iyọọ tutu asịm idaha a-ñnyịn iduọhọ idodanyen ibaña uwem. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Ke akpanikọ, ñnyịn imaikere ke iyaikpañña. Ado ami aketịppe mbaak ñnyịn idiibuọt idem ke idem ñnyịn ado ibuọt idem ke Abasi a-anamma akpañkpa aset. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Anye amainyaaña ñnyịn asio ke ekamba unọmọ, ayaanyʌñ amaana inyaaña ñnyịn. Ke anye, ke ñnyịn inie idodanyen ite ke anye ayaakaiso inyaaña ñnyịn, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />naña ndufo inwam ñnyịn ke mme akam ndufo. Ndin uwak awo eyaenọ ekọọm ke iwuod ñnyịn ke mfọn a-anye afọnnọ ye ñnyịn ato ñkpeubọk uwak awo.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pọọl Akpəho Akikere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Sia nduaak inua a-ñnyịn iduaha ado ami: Akikere esịd ñnyịn a-atie ntiense ke eduuwem ñnyịn ke ederimbod, akpan-akpan ke ewuana ñnyịn ye ndufo, a-adooho nnen-nnen ye ke akpanikọ abasi. Ñnyịn inyʌñ inam ntom, itooho ke ifiọk ederimbod, ado ato ke mfọn Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Sia ñnyịn iwette ñkpọ se ndufo imiidiikanna idiọọñọ se awuọñọ. Ami mmenie idodanyen ke <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />naña ndufo idiọọñọ ñnyịn ubaak-ubaak, eyaidiọọñọ ñnyịn ayọhọ-ayọhọ, nọ ato do ndufo ekan eduaak inua ibaña ñnyịn kpa naña ñnyịn idiiduaak inua ibaña ndufo ke usen Abọọñ Yisọs.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Sia ami mmaakenie mbuọdidem mbaña ñkpọ ami, ñkeduak adibemiso ndise ndufo nọ ndufo ebọ mfọn akañ iba. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ami ñkeduak adidi ndise ndufo ke ini ñkaaha Masidonia ñnyʌñ mmaana ndikịt ndufo ke unyọñọ Masidonia, nọ ndufo edinnọ miin ñka Yudia. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ke ini a-ami ñkenamma akikere ami, me ñkenam anye mfefeere-mfefeere? Me ñkenam akikere ami ke ido ederimbod nọ ato do ke uyio keed ami mbo, “ii, ii,” ye “Iyoo, Iyoo?”<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Ado nte Abasi adooho anam akpanikọ, ikọ a-ñnyịn ikwọrọke inọọ ndufo idooho “Ii” ye “Iyoo.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Sia Ayịn Abasi, Yisọs Krais, a-ami ye Sailas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Silfanus</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sailas</char></note> ye Timoti ikikwọrọke ke atu ndufo, ikidooho “Ii” ye “Iyoo,” ado ke anye asʌk ado “Ii” afịd-afịd ini. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Mme enwọñọ Abasi ekpewak naña ewawak ammọ edoñño “Ii” ke Krais. Ke ntoro, anyʌñ ato ke anye ñnyịn ibọọrọ “Amen” inọ Abasi ubọọñ. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Ndin ado Abasi akenam ñnyịn ye ndufo isọọñọ ida ke Krais. Anye amaiyet ñnyịn adan, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />inịm ñnyịn idiọọñọ a-awọttọ ke anye inie ñnyịn, anyʌñ ayaak Sịbidịd amọ asịn ke esịd ñnyịn nte ñkpọ ubiọñ anọ se idiidi.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Ami mmekoot Abasi mbo adido ntiense mmi, ñnyʌñ ntañ ke uwem mmi nte ke ami ñketre aditịmme ndi Kọrint mbaak ndinọọ ndufo mfịna. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Idooho nte ñnyịn ikaakara mbuọdidem ndufo, ado ñnyịn inam utom ye ndufo nọ enie idadesịd, sia ke mbuọdidem ke ndufo eda ke ñkpad iba.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ke ntoro ami mmaabiide ke esịd mmi nte ke ndiitịmmeke ndise ndufo ke usʌñ adiinọ ndufo ubiak. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Sia adieke ami nnamma nọ ndufo efʌhọ, anie ndin isʌhọ se idiinam esịd annem miin ke imiibọhọke kpa ndufo a-ami nnamma nọ efʌhọ? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ami ñkewet naña ñkewet ado, mbaak ami mmaadi ndidibọ mfʌhọ ke ubọk mbon e-ekpenamma nọ ami ñkop idadesịd. Ami mmaanie idodanyen ke afịd ndufo eyaewuana ke idadesịd mmi. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Akpọsọñ ukuud, mbʌññọesịd ye uwak mmọọñayịd ekenam ami ñwet ñwed ado inọ ndufo. Ikidooho adinam ndufo efʌhọ, ado nọ ndufo ediọọñọ ntotəño ima a-ami nnieghe inọọ ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adifeen Nnọọ Anam Ndudue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ado akpedo aba awo a-anamma mfʌhọ aba, inekkeke ido ami ke anye anọ mfʌhọ, akapado afịd ndufo, mbaak adiba nte mmenekke ndiọọk itañ. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Ufen se uwak awo enọ awo ado akem ye anye. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Akpena ndufo ekap efeen enọ anye, enyʌñ edọñ anye esịd, mbaak ekamba mfʌhọ adiben anye amen. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Ke ntoro, mmikpeiye ndufo nte emaana esọọñọ ima a-ndufo emaaha anye. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ntak mfen ami ñkiwette ndufo ado ke ñkeyem idiọọñọ me ndufo eyaekan eboiyo idomo enyʌñ enam item ke afịd ñkpọ. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Awo keed akeedodo a-ndufo efeene ñkpọ enọọ, ami ñko mmefeen nnọ awo ado. Ndin se ami mfeen, akpedo a-aba ñkpọ se akpena efeen, ami mmefeen ke iso Krais ke ntak ndufo, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />mbaak Setan adikan ñnyịn ubọk, sia ñnyịn imiinanake ifiọk ibaña ñkara amọ.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Akamautom Ufa Edioomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Ke ini ami ñkekaaha Troas adikwọrọ eti etob Krais, mmaakịt ke Abọọñ amaabeere usʌñ annọ miin, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />ami ñkinieghe emem ke sịbidịd sia mmeñkekịtte Taitọs ayịneka mmi awodeen ke Krais ke udo. Ndin mmaakọọm ammọ itiesʌñ mboiyo do ñkaa Masidonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ado ekọọm anie Abasi i-idatta ñnyịn usʌñ afịd-afịd ini nte ifʌn asaña ke adikan ke Krais, anyʌñ ikama ñnyịn asuan inem ufịk etob ifiọk amọ anwa-anwa ke afịd itie. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Sia ke atu mbon e-enyaañake ye mbon e-etakka ñnyịn ido anem ufịk adan ke Krais inọ Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ñnyịn ido idiọọk ufịk adatta ñkpa asọk usʌk awo, ado ikappa ido inem ufịk abenne uwem asọk mbon mfen. Ndin anie ikan inam utọ utom ado? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Ñnyịn ibaaha nte uwak awo e-enyamma ikọ Abasi edia udod. Utu ke ado, ke iso Abasi ñnyịn itañ ikọ ke Krais ke esịd akpanikọ nte mbon A-Abasi asiooho adọñ utom.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Ado nte ñnyịn imitọọñọ adimaana ntooro idem ñnyịn? Me ado nte ñnyịn iyem enọ ñwed itooro isọk ndufo, me ibọbọ ito ndufo naña usʌk awo eyem? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Ndufo ke idem ndufo edo ñwedetob a-ñnyịn iwette ke esịd ñnyịn a-afịd awo ediọọñọke enyʌñ ekoot. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Ndufo emewọt ke mmimọ ido ñwedetob a-atooho Krais, a-adooho ibọọrọ utom ukwọrọikọ ñnyịn, a-awo imiiwette ke mmọọññwed ikpọkidem, ado ewet ke Sịbidịd aduuwem Abasi, idooho ke itiad ñwed, ado ke awọñesịd awo.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Utọ uko ami ñnyịn inie ito Krais ke iso Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Idooho nte ñnyịn imikeme inam ñkpọ ndomokeed ke adudu idem ñnyịn; ado ukeme ñnyịn ato Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Anye anam ñnyịn inie ukeme adido mme asañautom ufa edioomo, idooho edioomo e-ewettewet, ado ado edioomo e-enamma ke Sịbidịd; sia mbed e-ewettewet awowot, ado Sịbidịd anọ uwem.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkponñkan Ubọọñ Ufa Edioomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Adieke usañautom a-akedatta ñkpa adi, e-ekekamake mme abiisi ekap ke itiad, akesañake ye ubọọñ adi, a-akenamma nditọ Isrel ikanna iwuuk anyen ise Moses iso ke ntak ubọọñ iso amọ, akpesʌkado imiikisọñọke ida; <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />nte usañautom ake Sịbidịd idiikappa idikpon ke ubọọñ ikan ami? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Adieke usañautom a-akebenne ubiomikpe adi a-akesañake ye ubọọñ, usañautom a-abenne adinenido adi adiikpon die ke ubọọñ! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Sia, ke akpanikọ, se ikinie ubọọñ inieghe ubọọñ aba ekpeben edomo ye ubọọñ a-akponno akan. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Sia adieke se ikiboiyo ifep a-akenieghe ubọọñ, die ndin ke ubọọñ i-imiidiiboiyoke ifep adiikpeene!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Ke ntoro, sia ñnyịn inieghe utọ idodanyen ami, ñnyịn iminekke inie ayọhọ uko. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Ñnyịn ibaaha nte Moses a-akedatta ufʌkiso afʌk iso mbaak nditọ Isrel edikịt utịd ubọọñ a-akeboiyoke afep. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ado emaenam akikere ammọ akappa ndisịme sia tutu asịm mfịn ufʌkiso ado asʌk ababa ke ini ekoodo akaan edioomo, sia ke Krais ikpọọñ ke adiboiyo ifep. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Ado tutu asịm mfịn ami, ufʌkiso ado asʌk afọfʌk esịd ammọ ke ini ekoodo ñwed Moses. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Ado ini akeedodo a-awo ndomokeed awọññọke akeene Abọọñ, e-eben ufʌkiso ado efep. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Abọọñ ado Sịbidịd, ndin itie nte Sịbidịd Abọọñ aba, uwuọufʌn aba do ñko. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Ndin afịd ñnyịn e-ekefʌkkọke iso imikan adikịt ubọọñ Abasi; ndin Abọọñ a-adooho Sịbidịd ikpəho ñnyịn idem asịn ke mbid amọ ke ubọọñ a-atooho Abọọñ, a-adooho Sịbidịd.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mmemidem Idahami ye Uwem Adised</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Sia adooho ke mbọm Abasi, ñnyịn iminie utom ami adinam, esịd iduọhọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Utu ke ado, ñnyịn imisịn mme ndedịbe ido e-esañake ye abuud. Ñnyịn ikamake ñkara, inyʌññọ idat nsu idian ye ikọ Abasi. Ado ke adiwọt se ido akpanikọ anwa-anwa ke inam afịd awo ediọọñọ ke esịd ammọ, ke ñnyịn inaanam se inen ke iso Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ndin akpekọm eti mbʌk ñnyịn aba ndịbe-ndịbe ke anyen awo, adịbe mbon e-etakkatak. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Ndin abasi ayio ami a-anam akikere mbon i-imiinịmme ke akpanikọ akịm, mbaak ammọ edikịt unwana eti etob ubọọñ Krais, a-adooho mbid Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Sia idooho idem ñnyịn ke ñnyịn ikwọrọ, ado ikwọrọ Yisọs Krais nte Abọọñ, ndin ñnyịn ido nditọufọk ndufo ke ntak Yisọs. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Sia Abasi akenọọhọ uyio ate, “Yak unwana ayamma ato ekịm,” amaanam unwana amọ ayamma ke esịd ñnyịn nọ anye anwaña awo anyen adidiọọñọ ubọọñ Abasi ke iso Krais.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ado ñnyịn ikama nsọñudua ñkpọ ami ke mme abañ mbad adiwọt ke ñkpon ñkan adudu ami ato Abasi, itooho ñnyịn. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />E-enekke ifiik ñnyịn ke afịd usʌñ, ado awo ikọkkọkọk; i-ifịna ñnyịn, ado ñnyịn iduọhọ idodanyen; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />i-ikọbọ ñnyịn, ado Abasi ikpọññọ ñnyịn; i-imia ñnyịn eduọọk ke isọñ, ado isoboke ñnyịn. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ñnyịn ikama ñkpa Yisọs ke ikpọkidem ñnyịn afịd ini isaña, nọ uwem Yisọs awuọ awọt idem ke ikpọkidem ñnyịn. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Sia afịd ini esiyaak ñnyịn i-iduuho uwem enọ ñkpa ke ntak Yisọs, nọ uwem Yisọs awuọ awọt idem ke abʌkidem ñnyịn a-adooho ayaakpa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ntom ndin, ke ñkpa asʌk anam utom ke idem ñnyịn, ado uwem asʌk anam utom ke idem ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ado sia ñnyịn inie sịbidịd mbuọdidem keed ye anye a-awette abo, “Mmaanịm ke akpanikọ, ke ntoro mmetañ,” ñnyịn ñko iminịm ke akpanikọ, inyʌñ itañ, <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />sia ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke a-anye a-akenamma Abọọñ Yisọs aset ke ñkpa, ayaanam ñnyịn ñko iset ye Yisọs; ayaanyʌñ idat ñnyịn ye ndufo anọ idem amọ. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Afịd ami ado ke ufọn ndufo, nọ mfọn asịmme uwak-uwak awo nọ ato do ekọọm ayọhọ aduọi anọ Abasi ubọọñ.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ke ntom, esịd iduọhọ ñnyịn. Ndin akpesʌkado a-ñnyịn imiinieghe inweek aba ke ikpọkidem, ado ke esịd idem Abasi asʌk isịn ñnyịn inweek ke usen ke usen. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Sia mme mfefeere ukuud a-ñnyịn ikịtte idahami esʌk ebọ nsi-nsi ubọọñ akponno akan afịd ammọ inọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Ke ntoro, ñnyịn isakka anyen ise se awo akịt ke anyen, ado isak ise se awo imiikịtte ke anyen a-adiikpeene ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ubed Ufa Ikpọkidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Sia ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke adieke ewuudo atayad a-ñnyịn idʌññọ ke isọñ, iminie nsi-nsi ufọk ke hefịn A-Abasi inọọhọ ñnyịn, a-awo imiidatta ubọk ibọp. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Sia ke ini inaaha ke atayad ami, ñnyịn isʌk ikuun inie udọñ adidʌk nsịne ke itie idʌñ Abasi ke hefịn, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />sia imaisịne afọñ, awo idiikịtte ñnyịn ifed. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Sia naña nte ñnyịn isịneke ke atayad ami, ñnyịn iba ke ñkuun ndin ifeefịghe ñnyịn ke esịd sia ñnyịn iyemme nọ isịññe ñnyịn afọn, ado iyem nọ isịn ñnyịn afọñ itieidʌñ ñnyịn ke hefịn, nọ ato do uwem aben ikpọkidem ñkpa amen. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Ndin andikibeeñe ñnyịn nnịm nnọọ ñkpọ ami ado Abasi, a-akinọọhọ ñnyịn Sịbidịd nte ubiọñ adiben ñwọt se idiidi ke ini iso.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Ke ntoro, ñnyịn iminie uko afịd ini, inyʌñ idiọọñọ ke adaña ini ñnyịn ibaaha ke ikpọkidem, ñnyịn ibaaha ye Abọọñ. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Sia ñnyịn idu uwem ke mbuọdidem, idooho ke se ikịt ke anyen. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Ami mbo ke ñnyịn iminekke inie uko adikpikpọñ ikpọkidem ami ñkeba ye Abọọñ. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ami anam ñnyịn inwana adinem anye esịd, ke adooho ñnyịn iba ke ufọk ke ikpọkidem me ibaaha. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Sia ana afịd ñnyịn iwuọ ida ke iso itie ikpe Krais nọ awo keedekeed abọ utịb a-akemme ye se anye akenam ke ikpọkidem, ke ñkpọ ado adooho eti, me anyʌññọ ado idiọọk.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utom Unam Emem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Sia adooho ñnyịn imidiọọñọ se adibaak Abọọñ ado, ñnyịn imidomo ukeme adikpak mbon mfen. Se ñnyịn ido ana inwañ-inwañ ke iso Abasi, ndin mmenie idodanyen ke inwaña ndufo ke akikere esịd ndufo ñko. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Idooho nte ñnyịn iyem aditịmme ntooro idem ñnyịn ke iso ndufo, ado inọ ndufo ufañ adidat ñnyịn nduaak inua, nọ ndufo enie se ebọọrọ mbon e-eduaha inua ke se ekịt ke anyen, idooho ke se ito eti esịd. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Sia adieke adooho iwuod iboiyo ñnyịn, naña usʌk awo ebo, ado ke ntak Abasi; anyʌñ ado ke ufọn ndufo adieke ñnyịn inieghe eti iwuod. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ado ima Krais idat ñnyịn usʌñ; sia iminịm ke awo keed akekpa anọ afịd awo, ke ntoro afịd awo emaekpañña. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Ndin anye akenyʌñ akpa anọ afịd awo mbaak mbon e-ebaaha ke uwem edidu uwem aba enọọ idem ammọ, ado edu uwem enọ anye a-akekpaaha anọ ammọ, e-ekenyʌññọ enam aset.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ke ntoro, tọọñọ ke idahami ñnyịn iseeghe awo ke anyen abʌkidem. Akpesʌkado a-ñnyịn ikidiọọñọke Krais ke abʌkidem, ñnyịn idiọọñọke anye aba ke utọ usʌñ ado. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ke ntoro, adieke awo abaaha ke Krais, emaebot anye ufa, ñkaan ñkpọ eboiyo efep; sese afịd ñkpọ ekappa edo ufa. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Ado afịd ñkpọ ato Abasi, a-akenamma ñnyịn itie ke emem ye anye ke Krais, a-akenyʌññọ inọọ ñnyịn utom, abo ñnyịn inam awo aba ke emem ye anye. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Abasi a-asịn emem ye anye ye ederimbod ke Krais, inyʌññọ ibat ndudue mme awo inọ ammọ, ado amaaben ikọ adikappa mba ke emem ye anye inọ ñnyịn ate ikwọrọ. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Ntom ke ñnyịn ido mme isʌñutom Krais nte ñkpọ A-Abasi idatta ñnyịn ikpe ndufo ubọk. Ñnyịn imikpeiye ndufo ke iwuod Krais: Ibono ke emem ye Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Abasi akenam anye i-imiikinieghe idiọọkñkpọ akappa ado idiọọkñkpọ inọ ñnyịn, nọ ato do ke anye ñnyịn ikappa ido adinenido Abasi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Nte mbon i-inamma utom keed inọọ Abasi, ñnyịn imikpe ndufo ubọk ite, ikiiyak mfọn Abasi a-ndufo ebọọhọ awuọ utak-utak. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Sia anye abo ntom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Ke ini mfọnido mmi ami mmauyie fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">ke usen adinyaaña ami mmaanyʌñ unyaaña fiin.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Sese, ini mfọn Abasi ado ami; sese usen adinyaaña amọ ado ami.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ufen Pọọl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Ñnyịn inịmme ñkpọ iduọ ke usʌñ awo ndomokeed, mbaak awo adibiat utom a-ñnyịn inamma. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Ado ke afịd usʌñ imiwọt ndufo ke ñnyịn ido ataa mme asañautom Abasi: Ke akwa adiyọ, ke ini ntịme, ke ukuud ye ke mbaba, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />ke ntiim, ke ñkpakọb ye ntịme, ke akpọsọñ utom, ke utaba idab ye ke ukpa abiọọñ, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />ke adisana ido, ke ifiọk, ke ime, ke mfọnido; ke Adisana Sịbidịd ye ke ataa ima, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />ke ikọ akpanikọ ye ke adudu Abasi; ye ñkpọekọñ adinenido ke ubọk nnasia ye ke ufiin, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />ke ini ukpono ye ke ini asuenne, ke idiọọk etob ye ke eti etob; i-ibat ñnyịn nte mbon abiaña, ado ñnyịn ido mbon akpanikọ; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />i-ibat ñnyịn nte mbon a-awo imiidiọọñọke, ado afịd awo idiọọñọ ñnyịn; nte mme akpañkpa, ke ini ibaaha ke uwem, nte mbon e-emiaha, ado iwottowot; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />i-idat ñnyịn nte mbon mfʌhọ, ado iba ke idadesịd afịd-afịd ini; nte mme uweene ado inam uwak awo enie ñkpọ; nte mme anana ñkpọ ke ini inieghe afịd ñkpọ.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Ñnyịn imineme nneme inwañ-inwañ ye ndufo mbon Kọrint, inyʌñ inwañña esịd ñnyịn inọ ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ñnyịn imitat esịd ima ndufo ado ndufo itatta esịd ndufo ima ñnyịn. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Inọ ñnyịn usiene akemme ke se ñnyịn inọọ ndufo; ntañ ami nte ntañ nnọ nditọ mmi. Inie inwañ-inwañ esịd ye ñnyịn.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndʌdutọñ a-Abañake Ukpono Ndem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ikiidian idem ndufo ye mbon i-imiinịmme Abasi ke akpanikọ. Nsoo ewuana ke adinenido anie ye ukwañ ido? Nsoo ewuana ke unwana anie ye ekịm? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Nsoo ewuana ke Krais anie ye Belial<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Belia</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belial</char></note>? Nsoo udeeme ke andinịm ke akpanikọ anie ye awo i-imiinịmme ke akpanikọ? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Nsoo edioomo ke tembịd Abasi anie ye mme usọsọiñkpọ? Sia ñnyịn ido tembịd aduuwem Abasi. Kpa naña Abasi abo ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Ami ñyaadʌñ ye ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ñnyʌñ nsaña ke atu ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">ndin ami ñyaado Abasi ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ammọ eyaenyʌñ edo ikọd mmi.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Ke ntoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Iwuọñọ ke atu afịd ammọ inyʌñ ibakka ida ke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">idem ndufo isio-isio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Ikiituuk ndedeghe ñkpọ ndomokeed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ndin ami ñyaidaara ndufo.”<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Ñko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">“Ami ñyaado Ete inọ ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">ntom ke Abọọñ Andikponñkan atañ.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Sia ñnyịn inieghe mme enwọñọ ami, mme ndima ufan mmi, yak ñnyịn iyet se ideghe ke abʌkidem ye sịbidịd isio ke idem ñnyịn, inam adisana ido ñnyịn afọn ama ke uteeñe Abasi.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pọọl Anem Esịd Abaña Ñkappaesịd Ufọkabasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Inịm itie ke esịd ndufo inọ ñnyịn. Ñnyịn idueghe awo ndomokeed, inyʌññọ ibiat awo ndomokeed, inyʌññọ itʌk awo ndomokeed. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ami ntañña ami adibiat ndufo, sia mmaatoto ntañ ke ndufo emenie itie ke esịd ñnyịn tutu akpekọm ñnyịn idodu, idu ye ndufo, inyʌññọ ikpakpa, ikpa ye ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ami ntañ ikọ inọ ndufo anwa-anwa. Nduakinua mmi ke idem ndufo anekke akpon, ndin ami mmenie ayọhọ idọñesịd, sia ke afịd ukuud ñnyịn idadesịd mmi akpon ataa eti-eti.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ke ini ñnyịn ikidiighe Masidonia, ñnyịn ke idem ñnyịn ikinieghe nduọkadudu, ado emaefịna ñnyịn ke afịd usʌñ, anwan ke esiin, ndịk ke esịd ufọk. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ado, Abasi a-adọññọ mbon ukuud esịd amaidọñ ñnyịn esịd ato ke adidi Taitọs, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />ndin idooho adidi amọ ikpọọñ, ado ke ndọñesịd a-ndufo ekenọọhọ anye. Anye amaidọkkọ ñnyịn abaña udọñ a-ndufo enieghe ennọọ miin, ye akpọsọñ mfʌhọ ndufo, naña ndufo enekke ekere embaña miin. Ndin ado amaanam idadesịd mmi atọọtʌm akpon akan naña akedo.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Adieke aketooho ke ñwedetob mmi ndufo efʌhọ, ami ntuaha ñkpọfiọk, ñkpəhoke akikere. Kpayeado ami mmaatua ñkpọfiọk ke naña mmaakekịt ke ñwedetob ado amaanam ndufo efʌhọ, ke ibio-ibio ini. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ado idahami, mmedat esịd, idooho sia mmaanam ndufo efʌhọ, ado sia mfʌhọ ndufo amaanam nọ ekappa esịd. Sia ndufo ekefʌhọ nte akemme ye uduak Abasi, ndin ñkpọ ndomokeed ikitooho ñnyịn inam ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Sia mfʌhọ a-atooho Abasi ananam awo akappa esịd ndin adat adinyaaña anọ awo, inyʌññọ isaña ye utua ñkpọfiọk, ado mfʌhọ ederimbod adat ñkpa adi. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Ndufo ese se mfʌhọ a-atooho Abasi adat adi ke idem ndufo: Ke adisịn ifịk ke utom Abasi, ke adibeeñe idem adikañ idem ndufo, ke iyadesịd, ke adikop ndịk, ke adinie udọñ, ke adikere se ikpido mfịna, ke adikịt ke e-enam unen. Ke afịd usʌñ ndufo emewọt idem nte mbon e-esanake ke ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ke ntoro, akpesʌkado ami mmaawet ñwed inọ ndufo, ikidooho ke ntak awo se ikidue me ke ntak awo se ikinie unọmọ, ado ñkewet mbo ayaara inọ ndufo ke iso Abasi naña ndufo enekke etat afịd esịd enie udọñ edikere ñkpọ ibaña ñnyịn. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Afịd ami ado se inọọ ñnyịn idọñesịd.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Ndin ke adidian ke idọñesịd ñnyịn, esịd amaanekke inem ñnyịn abaña naña Taitọs akenem esịd, sia afịd ndufo emenam sịbidịd amọ amaana ademme anye ke idem. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ami mmaaduaak inua nnọ anye ibaña ndufo, ndin ndufo innọọhọ miin ndọk. Ado kpa naña afịd se ñnyịn ikitañ ye ndufo akedooho akpanikọ, kpa ntoro ñko ke afịd nduaakinua a-ñnyịn ikiduaaha inọọ Taitọs ibaña ndufo anyʌññọ ado akpanikọ. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ndin anye a-adọdiọñ ima ndufo ke esịd amọ, akpan-akpan ke ini anye atoiyoke naña afịd ndufo ekekop item, enyʌñ ebọọ anye esịn ke ufọọd ndufo ke ndịk ye ñnyeñidem. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Mmedaara sia mmenie ayọhọ mbuọdidem ke idem ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Enọ e-Ebọọhọ Enọ Ikọd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Nditọeka mmi ke Krais, ñnyịn iyem ndufo ediọọñọ ebaña mfọn A-Abasi akenọọhọ mme ufọkabasi ke Masidonia. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Akpesʌkado a-ammọ ekebaaha ke ataa akpọsọñ ukuud, ayọhọ idadesịd ammọ ye akpọikpọi uweene ammọ amaawuọ awọt idem ke mfọọn ubọk enọ ammọ. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Sia ami ndo ntiense ke ammọ emaenọ ñkpọ naña ammọ ekekan, tutu enọ eboiyo naña ukeme ammọ akedo. Ke ataa unyịmme ammọ, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />ammọ emaesọsọp ibeeñe ñnyịn adinọ mmimọ ufañ adikeene ñwana ke adinam ñkpọ nọọ ikọd Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Ammọ emaenam ekan naña ñnyịn ikikere, sia ammọ emaebem iso eyaak idem enọ Abọọñ ndin ediyaak idem inọ ñnyịn ke unyimme Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ke ntoro ke ñnyịn inọ Taitọs uyio ibo, sia anye amaaketọọñọ utom mfọn ami, anye akpekap anam ama ke ufọọd ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Ado naña ndufo eboiyo iso ke afịd ñkpọ, ke mbuọdidem, ke utañ ikọ, ke ifiọk, ke unam ñkpọ ke afịdesịd, ye ke ima a-ndufo imaaha ñnyịn, iboiyo iso ñko ke utom mfọn adinọ enọ.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Idooho nte ami nnịm nte ewʌhọ, ado ñyem adise me ima ndufo ado ataa ima ke adiben ndomo ye udọñ esịd unam ñkpọ mbon mfen. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Sia ndufo emediọọñọ mfọn Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais, ke akpesʌkado a-anye akedooho imọ, anye amaakappa ado uweene ke ntak ndufo, nọ ato ke uweene amọ ndufo ekappa emọinyọ.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Ndin ubiere mmi ke abaña se ifọn ye ndufo ikan ke ñkpọ ami adom. Isua ako, ndufo ekedo akpa, idooho ke adinọ ikpọọñ, ado ke adinie udọñ adinam ntoro ñko. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Idahami, inam utom ado ima; nọ ato do naña ndufo ekenyịmme ke ayọhọ esịd adinam, ndufo ekan enam ema, akeene ukeme ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Sia adieke unyịmme esịd abaaha, Abasi abọ enọ akeene se awo anie, idooho se awo imiinieghe.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Udọñ ñnyịn idooho adibiommo mbon mfen mbiomo mben ifiik ndufo, ado nọ ato do afịd ñkpọ ado ukem-ukem. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Idahami, ndufo emenie se ikem adinọ ammọ se eyem; ndin ammọ eyaenyʌñ enie se ekama inọọ ndufo se eyem. Ndin ke akpatre ndukemme ayaaba, utʌk idiibaaha, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />kpa naña ewet ebo, “Awo andikikoono nọ anekke awak ikinieghe nọ awak abọhọ, ñko awo se ikikoono etək-etək ikinieghe nọ asịp abọhọ.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edọñ Taitọs Akebọ Enọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Mmekọọm Abasi a-asịnne ke esịd Taitọs ukem udọñ a-ami nnieghe inọ ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Sia anye ikibọọhọ ebeeñe ñnyịn ke inemesịd ikpọọñ, ado ayaibịne ndufo ke unyịmme esịd amọ ye ataa inemesịd. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Ñko, ayịneka ke Krais a-afịd mme ufọkabasi etooroke ke utom amọ ke abaña eti etob, ayaasaña ye anye adi. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Ke akanna ado, mme ufọkabasi emaemek anye ebo asaña ye ñnyịn ye enọ e-ekebọọhọ, a-ñnyịn ikamake inam utom adinọ Abasi ubọọñ ñnyʌñ ñwọt udọñ a-ñnyịn inieghe adinwam. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ñnyịn itọọtʌm ikpeme, mbaak awo aditañ se mmifọnnọ idian ñnyịn ibaña naña ñnyịn ikama enọ ima esịd ami. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Sia ana isuuk anyen inam se inen, idooho ke iso Abasi ikpọọñ, ado ye ke iso awo ñko.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Ñko iminyʌñ idian ayịneka ñnyịn keed ke Krais amaakiwọt ñnyịn ke uwak usʌñ ke imọ imisịn inweek eti-eti ke utom, ndin idahami anyʌñ adọọdiọñ asịn esịd ke utom ami akpan-akpan sia anye a-anekke ifiọiyo ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Amaado Taitọs, anye ado awo ñwuana utom ye ami, a-asañake ye ami anam utom ke ufọọd ndufo; ndin nditọeka ke Krais mbon ako edo mme isʌñutom enọ mme ufọkabasi, enyʌñ edat ubọọñ enọ Krais. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Ke ntoro, iwọt ibon ami idiọọñọ ima ndufo ye ntak a-ñnyịn idatta ndufo inam inua, nọ mme ufọkabasi ekịt.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Enọ e-Ebọọhọ Enọ Ufọkabasi ke Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ufọn ibaaha ami adiwet inọọ ndufo mbaña utom mfọn e-enamma enọ mme ndisana ikọd Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Sia mmediọọñọ ke ndufo emenie udọñ adinwam, mmenyʌñ idat ndufo nduaak inua nnọ mbon Masidonia mbo ke tọọñọ isua ako, ndufo ke Akaya emaebeeñe idem adinọ enọ; ndin eti udọñ ndufo amaademme udọñ uwak ammọ. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Ado ami mmedọñ mme nditọeka ke Krais edi ibịne ndufo mbaak nduaak inua a-ñnyịn inamma ibaña ndufo adiwuọọñọ ikpu-ikpu, ado nọ ndufo eba ke mbeeñeidem naña ami ñkebo. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Sia adieke awo Masidonia ndomokeed asañake ye ami adi ndin adikịt naña ndufo imiikibeeñeke idem, iyaikop abuud akeene inua se ñnyịn ikiduaak. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ntom ke ami ñkekere mbo ke a-afọn adikpeiye nditọeka ke Krais ubọk mbo yak ammọ ebemiso edi ukañ ndufo, enyʌñ ekweeñe mme ndutʌm enọ ntadubọk a-ndufo ekenwọñọke adinọ. Ndin ayaado se enọ anye nte enọ ima esịd, idooho nte anye e-enọọhọ ke ufiik.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufọn Adinọ ke Ntadubọk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Itoiyo ibo ke awo a-atọọhọ etək-etək adiidọk etək-etək; awo a-atọọhọ ke ntadubọk, adiidọk uwak-uwak. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Awo keedekeed akpena anọ naña anye akeduak ke esịd amọ, ke anọọ mmeeñe-mmeeñe, me nte enyeenyịk; sia Abasi amama awo a-anọọhọ ke inemesịd. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Ndin Abasi ayaidiọñ ndufo ke uwak-uwak usʌñ, nọ ato ke afịd ñkpọ ye ke afịd ini ndufo enieñe afịd se eyem enyʌñ eyọhọ ye afịd nti utom. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kpa naña ewet:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Ammọ esuan inie ammọ enọ uweene ke ntadubọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">adinen ido ammọ a-asọọñọ ada ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Ndin, anye a-anọọhọ atọ inwañ ñkpasi nọ atọ, a-anyʌññọ anọ udia, ayainọ ndufo uwak-uwak ñkpasi ke ise ndufo, anyʌñ anam idọk mfịd adinenido ndufo awak. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Eyaenam ndufo enie ñkpọ ke afịd usʌñ nọ ndufo ekan enọ ke ntadubọk afịd-afịd ini, ndin ato ke ñnyịn, enọ ntadubọk ndufo ayaadat ekọọm asọk Abasi.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Sia utom a-ndufo enamma itreke ke adinọ ndisana ikọd Abasi se ammọ enana, ado adat uwak ekọọm anọ Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Ke ntak utom mfọn a-ndufo edoññoke uwọdñkpọ, mbon mfen eyaetooro Abasi ke ñkobitem a-asañake ye nsuukiwuod a-ndufo enọọhọ eti etob Krais, ye ntadubọk ndufo ke adiwuana ye ammọ ye afịd mbon mfen. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Ammọ ke idem ammọ ñko e-ebọñ akam inọ ndufo enyʌñ enie udọñ adisoobo ye ndufo ke ntak ekamba mfọn Abasi a-abaaha ye ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Ekọọm anie Abasi ke enọ amọ i-inua imiikanna itañ!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pọọl Asọọñọ Ayịre ke Utom Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Ndat nsuukidem ye mmem-mmem ido Krais nnịm ebeeñe ke iso ndufo. Ami Pọọl, ambaaha idek-idek ke mmaatie iso ye iso ye ndufo, ado nsọñ inua ini a-mmembaaha ye ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ami mmikpe ndufo ubọk nte mmaadi ukañ ndufo, ke ado se ndisọñ inua ye ndufo, nte naña nduak adisọñ ye ubaak awo e-ebatta ke ñnyịn isaña naña ubonoñkpọ ederimbod ado. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Sia akpesʌkado a-ñnyịn idʌññọ ke ederimbod ami, ñnyịn inwanake ekọñ naña ederimbod enwana. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Mme ñkpọekọñ se ñnyịn ikama inwana ekọñ, idooho ñkpọekọñ ederimbod, ado ammọ e-enie adudu a-atooho Abasi adiwuut mme ñkpọsọñ ufọkekọñ. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Ñnyịn iwuut mfaaña awo ye afịd ñkokkoidem e-ebenneke idem enwana ye ifiọk Abasi, inyʌñ isịn afịd ndiọi akikere ukad adinam ammọ esuuk iwuod enọ Krais. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Nsuukiwuod ndufo amaafọn akem, ñnyịn iyaibeeñe idem adinọ mbon nsọñiwuod ufen.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Ndufo ese ñkpọ anyọñ-anyọñ. Awo akeedodo a-anịmme ke mmimọ ido ake Krais, yak ammọ etʌm ekere ke naña mmimọ ido ake Krais, kpa ntoro ke ñnyịn ido ñko. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ndin akpekọm ami ñkpenam inua anwa-anwa mbaña adudu A-Abọọñ akinọọhọ ñnyịn adidat nnam ndufo ekọt, abuud idinnamma miin ibaña anye. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Ñyemme nọ aba nte ami ñyem idat mme ñwedetob mmi isịn ndufo ndịk. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Sia usʌk awo ebo: “Mme ñwedetob amọ edoppo enyʌñ enie adudu ado anye ke idem amọ inieghe se adʌk, ndin ikọ inua amọ ñko idooho ñkpọ ndomokeed.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Akpena utọ ibon ado ediọọñọ ke se ñnyịn ido ke mme ñwedetob ñnyịn ke ini ñnyịn imiibaaha, kpa ado ke ñnyịn idiido ke adinam ñnyịn imaiba ye ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ñnyịn ikpikanna idat idem ñnyịn idomo ye ubaak awo e-etooroke idem ammọ. Ke ini ammọ edomoke idem ye idem ammọ, enyʌññọ ekpe ikpe idem ammọ, ammọ inieghe aniọñ. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ado ñnyịn idiinamma inua iboiyo adaña, idiinam inua ikeene utom A-Abasi inọọhọ ñnyịn, a-adooho utom ñnyịn ye ake ndufo asịne do ñko. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ñnyịn iboiyoke adaña ke ñwọkinua ñnyịn naña akpedo adieke ñnyịn imiikpikidieghe ibịne ndufo, sia ñnyịn imaidisoobo ndufo ye eti etob Krais. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Ñnyịn iboiyoke adaña ke adinam inua mbaña utom mbon mfen. Idodanyen ñnyịn ado, naña mbuọdidem ndufo aka iso akọt, adaña utom ñnyịn ke atu ndufo ayaakaiso atara; <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />nọ ñnyịn ikan ikwọrọ eti etob ke mme itie mfen. Sia ñnyịn iyemme inam inua mbaña utom a-mbon mfen emaekenam ke efaak utom ammọ. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Ado, “Yak awo a-akpọọhọ inua akpọ ke Abọọñ.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Sia idooho awo a-atooroke idem ke edat nte eti, ado awo A-Abọọñ atooroke.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Pọọl ye mme Nsu-nsu Abọsịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Mmenie idodanyen ke ndufo eyaeyọ ye ami ke etək ndisịme mmi. Mbọk inwana inam ntoro. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ami mmenie ufịb Abasi ibaña ndufo, sia ñkidat ndufo nnọ ebe keed, a-adooho Krais, nọ ami iyaak ndufo nnọ anye nte adisana abọikpa. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ado ami mmenie ndịk sia naña udʌkikọd akebiaña Iif ke ñkara, kpa ntoro ke esịd ndufo akeme adiwuọ ñkpọñ akpanikọ ye eti ido ke Krais. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Sia adooho awo akpedi adikwọrọ Yisọs a-akpəhoke ye Yisọs a-ñnyịn ikikwọrọke; ñko ndufo ikpinyʌñ ibọọ sịbidịd a-akpəhoke ye Sịbidịd a-ndufo ekebọọhọ, me enyʌññọ ebọọ eti etob a-akpəhoke ye anye a-ndufo ekebọọhọ eto inua ñnyịn, ndufo ibiada ini adinyịmme nnọọ ammọ.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ado ami ñkereke mbo ke ami nsịp ñkan mbon e-ebatta nte mme “akaakan ke atu mme abọsịd.” <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Akpesʌkado ami mmembọọhọ ukpeeb nte awo ndọọn ikọ ado mmenie ifiọk. Ñnyịn iminam ami anekke inwaña ndufo ke afịd usʌñ. <verse eid="2CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Me akedo idiọọkñkpọ ami adikisuuk idem mmi nọ ato do idịppe ndufo ke adikwọrọ eti etob Abasi inọọ ndufo ke mfọn? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Mmaafiik mme ufọkabasi mfen mbọ unwam nto ammọ nọ ndat nnam ñkpọ inọ ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ke ini ami ñkebaaha ye ndufo ñnyʌñ ñyem unwam, ami ñkidooho mbiomo nnọ baaba awo ndomokeed, sia nditọeka ke Krais e-eketooho Masidonia edi emaennọ miin se ñkeyem. Ami mmedʌt idem mmi nsio adido mbiomo inọọ ndufo ke baaba usʌñ ndomokeed, ndiinyʌñ ñkakaiso nnam ntoro. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Adaña nte akpanikọ Krais ambaaha miin ke idem, awo ndomokeed ke afịd Akaya idiitreke ñkpọinua mmi. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ntak-a? Ado nte ami imaaha ndufo? Abasi adiọọñọ ke mmima ndufo!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Ndin ami ñyaasʌk ñkaiso nnam se ami nnam nọ ato do mbiat uduak mbon e-eyemme ufañ adido ukem ye ñnyịn ke ñkpọ a-ammọ enamma inua ebaña. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Sia utọ ibon ado edo mme abọsịd nsu, mme anam utom abiaña, e-ebenne ñkpọ efʌhọ enam nte ido mme abọsịd Krais. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Idooho ñkpọ ñkpaidem, sia Setan ke idem amọ afọfʌhọ ñkpọ nọ atie nte ado enyere unwana. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Idooho ñkpọ ñkpaidem ndin, adieke mme asañautom Setan ebiotto mme asañautom adinenido. Ado utịd ammọ ayaakem ye ubọkutom ammọ.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pọọl Aduaak Inua Abaña Ufen Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Mmemaana ntañ: Yak awo ndomokeed akundat miin nte ndisịme. Ado ikpindat nte ndisịme, iñyọ miin nte ndisịme, nọ ami ñkan nduaak inua etək. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Ke nduaak inua mmi, ntañña naña Abọọñ akpetañ, ado ntañ nte ndisịme. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Sia uwak awo eduaak inua naña ederimbod enam, ami ñko ñyaakeene nnam ntoro. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ndufo emekop inemesịd adiyọ ye mme ndisịme, sia ndufo emediọọñọ ñkpọ eti-eti. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ke akpanikọ, ndufo emeyọ awo akeedodo i-isịnne ndufo ke ufʌn, ye anye a-adiaha inie ndufo, ye anye a-atañña idem, ye awo awọttọ idem, me awo isiaaha ndufo ufia. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Mmekop abuud adinyịmme ke ñnyịn imaimem ibọhọ ke mme ñkpọ ado!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Se awo akeedodo mfen akpenie uko adiduaak inua mbaña, yak ntañ nte ndisịme, ami mmenie uko adiduaak inua mbaña ñkpọ ado ñko. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Me ammọ edo mbon Hibru? Ntoro ke ami ndo. Me edo mbon Isrel? Kpa ntoro ke ami ndo. Me ammọ edo ubon Ebraham? Ntoro ke ami ndo. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Me ammọ edo mme isʌñutom Krais? (Ami ntañ nte awo i-iwuod aboiyoke), ami mmekan ammọ. Mmenam akpọsọñ utom ñkan ammọ, mba ke ufọk ñkpakọb uwak-uwak ini ñkan ammọ, emmia ataa akpọsọñ-akpọsọñ ekan ammọ, ensio enọ ñkpa ndin-ndin. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Ami mmaabọ ubọk ikpa edịb mme duob mme usʌkkeed nto mme Yuu akañ ition. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ekedat eto ukwak entịm miin akañ ita, entọ ke itiad akañ keed, ubom mmi asịp akañ ita, mmaanaa ke akpainyañ ibom akonayio keed ye uweemeayio keed. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Uwak-uwak ini ke mme isañ mi, mmekịt mfịna ke mme inyañ, mmekịt afanekọñ ke atu mbon inọ, mmekịt afanekọñ ke ubọk emọ-emọ mbon Yuu, mmekịt afanekọñ ke ubọk mme Gentile, mmekịt afanekọñ ke ekamba abio, mmekịt afanekọñ ke esịd idʌñ, mmekịt afanekọñ ke akpainyañ, mmekịt afanekọñ ke ubọk nsu-nsu ibon i-imiinịmme ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Ami mmenam akpọsọñ utom ñnyʌñ ñwa idem, ntaba idab uwak ini; mmetie abiọọñ uwak-uwak ini ami, ñkop nsaditọñ ñnyʌñ nnana se ndia; mmenana afọñ se nsịne, atueb anyʌñ ammʌm. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Ke esioho afịd ami efep, ami mba ke akpọsọñ akikere ye ifiikesịd afịd usen mbaña afịd mme ufọkabasi. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Anie ke idem amem, ndin idem atre adimmem miin? Anie ke enịm ñkpọiduọ enọ nọ adʌk idiọọkñkpọ, ndin esịd mmi atre ibara nte ikañ?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Adieke anaaha nte ami nduaak inua, ndiiduaak ke mme ñkpọ ewọttọ mmemidem mmi. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Abasi ye Ete Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs, a-anaaha etooro ke nsi-nsi, a-adiọọñọ ke ami nsʌhọke nsu. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ke Damaskọs a-kọfnọ ke idak ukara Adidem Aretas amaanịm mbon ukpeme ke abio ate emmʌm miin. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ado emaensịn miin ke akpasa, ensio ke ubenafịm esuuk ke mben ndibene tutu nsịm isọñ, ntoro ke ñkefiọnnọ mbọkkọ anye.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkukịd ye Ukuud Pọọl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ana ami ñka iso nduaak inua. Akpesʌkado udod ndomokeed imiibaaha, ami ñyaakaa iso ke ñkukịd ye mme adiyaara e-etooho Abọọñ. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ami mmediọọñọ awo keed a-abaaha ke Krais, e-ekebenne edọọk ayọhọ hefịn ita ke isua duob mme inaañ a-akeboiyoke. Me akedo ke ikpọkidem me amaakpọñ ikpọkidem, ami ndiọọñọke, Abasi adiọọñọ. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Ndin ami mmediọọñọ ke awo ami, me ke ikpọkidem, me emaesio ke ikpọkidem, ado Abasi adiọọñọ, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />emaeben anye edʌk paradais. Anye amaakop uwak ñkpọ se inua imiikikanna itañ, mme ñkpọ se ediikiyakka awo atañ. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Ami ñyaanam inua mbaña awo ntoro, ado ndiinamma inua mbaña idem mmi, ado ñyaanam inua mbaña mmemidem mmi. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Akpekọm ami ñkpemek adiduaak inua, ami ñkpidooho ndisịme, ke ntak a-adooho se ñkpetañ ado akpanikọ. Ado nnamma, mbaak awo adikere ñkpọ a-akponno akan se ami ndo ye se ami nnam ñnyʌñ ntañ. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Sia se eyaara ennọọ miin a-akpon eti-eti. Ke ntoro, mbaak ami ndiwọt idem mbọhọ, emaeñwuuk miin ñkukịm ke abʌkidem, a-adooho isʌñutom Setan adinnọ miin ufen. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ami mmaakpeiye Abasi akañ ita nte aben ñkpọ ami añkpọñ miin. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Ado anye amaandọkkọ miin ate, <char style="wj">“Mfọn mmi ukem fiin udeeme, sia enam adudu mmi afọn ama ke mmemidem.”</char> Ke ntoro, ami ñyaaduaak inua ke idadesịd ñkan naña ñkenanam mbaña mmemidem mmi, nọ ato do adudu Krais andodo miin ke idem. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ke ntak Krais, ami mmedaara ke mmemidem, ke asuenne, ke nsọñọñkpọ, ke ukọbọ, ye ke mfịna. Sia ke ini ami ñkoppo mmemidem, idahado ke nnekke ñkop nsọñidem.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pọọl Akere Abaña Mbon Kọrint</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ami mmekappa ndo ndisịme; ado ndufo ekennək esịn ke ndisịme. Akpena ndufo ekentooro miin, sia ami nsịppesịp ñkan mme “ñkpoon ñkan abọsịd,” akpesʌkado a-ami mmendooho ñkpọ ndomokeed. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ami mmaasọọñọ nda ke adiwọt ndufo anwa-anwa mme idiọọñọ eti abọsịd, ñkọrọ ye mme idiọọñọ, mme ñkpọ ñkpaidem ye mme utịppeñkpọ. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ndufo ekesaña die eba ke usuuk itie ekan mme ufọkabasi mfen ke mmidooho ke ami ñkidooho mbiomo inọ ndufo? Idakka do innọ miin ke ndudue ami.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Idahami, ami mmebeeñe idem adidi ndise ndufo ayọhọ akañ ita, ndin ami ndiidooho mbiomo inọ ndufo; sia se ami ñyem idooho inie ndufo, ado iyem ndufo idem. Sia ntəkayịn ikpinaaha enịm nnịmnnọidem enọ ete ye eka ammọ, ado mme ete ye eka ekpenaa enịm nnịmnnọidem enọ nditọ. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Ndin ami ñyaabiat ke inemesịd, afịd se nnie ye idem mmi ñko inọ ndufo. Adieke ami imaaha ndufo ayọhọ-ayọhọ, nte ima a-ndufo enieghe ennọ miin akpena asịp akan ima mmi? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Akọm naña aba ntoro, ami ñkidooho mbiomo inọ ndufo. Ado sia ami ndooho awo ñkara, ami mmaimʌm ndufo ke ñkara ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Anie nte ami ñkifiik ndufo mbọ ñkpọ nto awo ndomokeed se ñkedọñ utom inọọ ndufo? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ami mmaakpeiye Taitọs nte adi ukañ ndufo ñnyʌñ ndọñ ayịneka keed ke Krais nte asaña ye anye. Taitọs ikifiighe ndufo, nte amaifiik? Nte ñnyịn ikisañake ke Sịbidịd keed ye ke usʌñ keed?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Ndufo ekere ke afịd se inwana itañ ami ado ñnyịn adinyaaña idem ñnyịn ke iso ndufo? Ñnyịn itie ke iso Abasi itañ mme ikọ ami nte mbon e-ebaaha ke Krais; ndin afịd se inam, mme ndima ufan, ado adisọọñọ ndufo idem. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Sia ami mmenie ndịk nte ke mmaadi, akeme inam ami ikịtte ndufo naña ñkpeyem ndufo eba, ndufo ñko idiñkịtte miin naña ekpeyem ami mba. Ami mmenie ndịk mbaña utọk, ye ufịb, ye ifiobesịd, ye ubakka, ye ubiad anyịñ ye idiọọk ibaaña, ye ñkokkoidem ye ndutịme, ke ufọọd ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ami mmenie eyịghe ke mmaatịmme ndi Abasi mmi ayansuuhọ miin ke iso ndufo, ndin ami ñyaafʌhọ mbaña uwak awo e-ekedakka enañña ndiọiñkpọ ke ini a-akeboiyoke, ado ikappake esịd itua ñkpọfiọk, ikpọñ ndubiam ido, ye use, ye efịbe, inyʌññọ isịññe idem ikpọñ unana mfadidem ke uwem ammọ.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ndʌdutọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Anye ami adiido ayọhọ akañ ita a-ami ndiighe ndise ndufo. “Ana esọọñọ afịd ñkpọ eto ikọ ntiense awo iba me ita.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ami mmaatoto idʌt ndufo utọñ ke ini ñkebaaha ye ndufo ayọhọ akañ iba. Idahami, mmemaana nnam ntoro ke ini ami mmiibaaha ye ndufo. Mmaanyọñ ndi, ndiifeene nnọ mbon emaekenam idiọọkñkpọ ke ini a-akeboiyoke ye mbon mfen, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />sia ndufo eyemme idiọọñọ ke Krais aboiyo anto miin atañ mme ikọ ami. Anye idooho mmem-mmem ke adinam ñkpọ ye ndufo, ado a-anie adudu ke atu ndufo. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Sia akpesʌkado ekekọññọ anye ke krọs ke mmemidem, anye asʌk adodu uwem ke adudu Abasi. Kpa ntoro ñnyịn imimem idem ke anye, ado ke adudu Abasi, ñnyịn iyaidu uwem ye anye ke adinam ñkpọ inọọ ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Iduuñọ idem ndufo ise me ndufo eba ke mbuọdidem; itʌm idomo idem ndufo. Nte ndufo idiọọñọke ke Krais Yisọs adọdʌñ ke idem ndufo? Miidooho ntoro, ke akpanikọ, ndufo iboiyoke udomo. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ndin ami mmedot anyen ke ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke ñnyịn iwuọhọ ubọk ñkaña. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ñnyịn ibọñ akam inọ Abasi ibo ke ndufo inam se idiọọk, idooho nọ mme awo ikịt ñnyịn nte nti awo, ado nọ ndufo enam se inen, akpesʌkado abaaha nte ñnyịn imaidue. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ñnyịn ikanna adinam baaba ñkpọ ndomokeed adibiọọñọ akpanikọ, ado ida ke akpanikọ ikpọọñ. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ñnyịn idaadat esịd ke ini akeedodo a-ñnyịn ibaaha ke mmemidem, ado ndufo emesọñ idem; ndin akam ñnyịn ado yak ndufo ekappa efọn ema. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ntak ami anam nọ ñwet mme ñkpọ ami ke ini mmembaaha ye ndufo, mbaak ami mmaadi ndisọñ ido ye ndufo ke naña ami ñkama adudu mmi, adudu A-Abọọñ akennọọhọ miin adidat nnam ndufo ekọt, idooho adidat isuan ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ekọọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ke akpatre, nditọeka mmi ke Krais, idaara! Yak udọñ ndufo ado adikappa mfọn mma, ikpañ utọñ ke ebeeñe mmi, inie esịd keed, idʌñ emem-emem. Ndin Abasi ima ye emem ayaaba ye ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ikọọm emọ-emọ ye adisana ntʌminua.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Afịd ikọd Abasi mmi e-enọ ekọọm.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Yak mfọn Abọọñ Yisọs Krais, ye ima Abasi ye ewuana Adisana Sịbidịd aba ye afịd ndufo.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>